  "backgroundPrompt": "Use case: precise-object-edit. Edit the supplied square beach scene into an empty background plate for a layered 2D cleaning game. Preserve exactly the square framing, horizon position, camera, sunlight, turquoise ocean waves, distant island, sky, palm foliage at frame edges, beach sand texture, and small scattered litter on sand. Remove ONLY these four main objects and their cast shadows: the large red-and-cream striped umbrella at upper left INCLUDING its pole and hanging seaweed, the refreshment kiosk at upper right INCLUDING cups and canopy, the turquoise-cushioned lounge chair at lower left INCLUDING legs and seaweed, and the small boat at lower right INCLUDING its attached rope and seaweed. Reconstruct the revealed background with sky, sea, shoreline or sunlit sand according to position. No new props, no people, no text. This plate is only used beneath exact source-pixel sprite masks; do not redesign the existing background. 1:1 square image."
